\newlabel{tab:case_rank}{{4}{14}{\textbf {PrimeKG diagnostic cases of candidate promotion and evidence compression.} Base and Soft denote gold-drug ranks before and after soft-support reranking; Removed is the number of triples discarded by fuzzy retrieval. These cases audit rank and evidence changes rather than provide treatment recommendations}{table.4}{}}
